    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem brocard_conjecture (n : ℕ) (hn : 1 ≤ n) :\n    letI prev := n.nth Nat.Prime;\n    letI next := (n+1).nth Nat.Prime;\n    4 ≤ ((Ioo (prev^2) (next^2)).filter Nat.Prime).card",
